  "ALL_TEXT": "68 EXT. TV CHANNEL OFFICE-PARKING - DAY\nSULOCHANA comes out; VEDA, nervous, walks up to her.\nSULOCHANA\nPhotos inkaa media ki release\ncheyaledhu... police station lo\nunnaayi. Akkadiki velthe kaani\nasalu emjarigindho clear gaa\nthelidhu\nVEDA\nP.S Kaa!?. Mammalni kudaa\nrammantaava?\nSULOCHANA\n(suspiciously)\nYe? Em cheyaledannav ga...\nRaataaniki enti??\nVEDA\nNak Em ledhu.. GOVARDHAN nasa\npedathadu sarle elago ala manage\nchestha...\nVEDA and SULOCHANA walk up to GOVARDHAN, who waits,\nimpatiently.\nVEDA\nGOVARDHAN padhaa\nGOVARDHAN\nMalli ekkadiki\nVEDA\nNuvvu mee bank lo entha powerfulo\nani SULOCHANA ki cheppaa. Thanaki\nkuda queue lo nilabadakunda\nchusthaav ani cheppa.\nGOVARDHAN is visibly flattered and falls for it. The trio\nwalk towards SULOCHANA\u2019s car, which is parked nearby in the\nlot. GOVARDHAN opens the passenger door and gets inside.\nSULOCHANA\nDigu, meemu ekkaali\nGOVARDHAN\nAtu vaipu oka door undi kadhaa\nSULOCHANA\nBha! Digu, adhi open avvadhu\nGOVARDHAN\nAnduke puraavasthu shaaka nunchi\ncar konnnaru\nSULOCHANA stares down GOVARDHAN, after which GOVARDHAN climbs\noff. SULOCHANA gets in; VEDA and GOVARDHAN stand, waiting for\nthe other to get in.\nGOVARDHAN\nEkku\nVEDA\nNenekkute nuvvu ela ekkutaavu\nGOVARDHAN\nEkki lopala kurcho. Mundu nenu\nkurchuntaanu.\nVEDA\nNuvvu lopala elli kurcho, nenu\nmundu kurchuntaanu\nGOVARDHAN\nRei, nee gurinchi naaku telusu\nkaani, poi lopala kurcho, ellu.\nVEDA reluctantly gets in the back. The trio leaves.\nCUT TO:",
